1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,397
POCO, WHERE YOU 'VE BEEN?!

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:06,500
HOW DARE YOU LEAVE THE HOUSE LIKE THIS?!

3
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:09,417
Please, Papa!

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,960
Papa, I'm sorry I left the
house, but where's my sister?

5
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:15,577
Well, where do you think?

6
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,189
She's out looking for you.

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,700
What?! No, Papa! Don't see that!

8
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,349
Tell me she didn't go out!

9
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,500
POCO, what's ailing you?

10
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,229
You're not behaving right.

11
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,857
My sister!

12
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:31,280
My sister! I don't know.

13
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:54,097
I'll see you

14
00:01:54,180 --> 00:02:00,480
next time.

15
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,700
Consider this, dear.

16
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:18,260
Examine this rose in
bloom for but a moment.

17
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:22,820
Vibrant, fresh, and young, what
you see is a mirror of your youth.

18
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:26,697
Consider this fact
carefully, Mademoiselle.

19
00:02:26,780 --> 00:02:31,640
From the first moment this flower
fully blooms, it begins to wither.

20
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,980
A shame, don't you think?

21
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,820
Only sixteen!

22
00:02:36,220 --> 00:02:39,240
So sweet, so innocent and pure now!

23
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:43,740
So full of delicious life
energy, wonderful Lord Dio!

24
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:54,220
Those lacking in manners
are not fit to exist.

25
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:58,820
Now, Mademoiselle, I
offer unto you a choice.

26
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:04,440
Would you not care to enjoy your
youth and beauty for all eternity?

27
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,620
Fret not, my dear.

28
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:10,547
I shall not force my friendship
upon you like others might do.

29
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,520
You control your life.

30
00:03:12,740 --> 00:03:15,240
You hold your destiny in your own hands.

31
00:03:16,380 --> 00:03:18,160
You fiend. Eh?

32
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,660
How's that again?

33
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:29,580
You wear the flesh, but you're not a man.

34
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,120
Devil, go away!

35
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:57,600
Alas, although your acquaintance will
be brief, let me introduce my companion.

36
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:06,760
I present unto you, Doobie, as
regrettably I am not to your taste,

37
00:04:06,980 --> 00:04:08,600
enjoy your time with him.

38
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:11,020
Au River, mademoiselle.

39
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,860
I knew it, me!

40
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,580
Doesn't matter, does it?

41
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,280
You're a zombie.

42
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:40,071
Your kind don't deserve any introductions.

43
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,280
Sister! Pukul!

44
00:04:57,780 --> 00:04:58,610
Bitchy!

45
00:04:58,693 --> 00:05:00,137
Bitch on your bright little face!

46
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:01,050
What did that?

47
00:05:01,340 --> 00:05:02,869
What's he got under there?

48
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,880
His mask! Look at it!

49
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,630
Look down!

50
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,600
Run, run, run!

51
00:05:16,060 --> 00:05:17,280
That zombie!

52
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:20,300
He's chock-a-block with
serpents! All sorts!

53
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:23,280
Venomous cobras,
flesh-eating asps and vipers!

54
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:25,360
Bit surprised, are ya?

55
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,920
They sank their fangs in his face!

56
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,580
And more than just once!

57
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:32,920
How wearisome!

58
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:37,085
I haven't the time to deal with
any more of Dio's foolish games!

59
00:05:44,700 --> 00:05:45,530
Damn.

60
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:46,522
Very well done.

61
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,880
He squeezed out the poison. Good control.

62
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:54,357
He's learnt a great deal about blood
flow in a very short amount of time.

63
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,320
Baron Zeppeli!

64
00:05:55,580 --> 00:05:59,815
He's helping our boy after giving
Jonathan his life energy when he died!

65
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:04,337
I'll use a bit of the
great hormone I possess

66
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:07,008
to turn these serpents
back on their master!

67
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,400
No!

68
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,230
No!

69
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:15,140
Sister!

70
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:16,900
Hooker! Sister!

71
00:06:51,900 --> 00:06:54,397
Guess who survived his time in hell, Dio?

72
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,840
You are alive, Jojo!

73
00:06:57,660 --> 00:06:58,490
Curious?

74
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:00,537
I suppose.

75
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:02,837
Logically, that would then indicate!

76
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,917
You have killed my two knights.

77
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,597
Lord Dio!

78
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,877
We await your order to reduce him.

79
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,607
into a pile of bloody flesh.

80
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:13,500
Lord, let my fangs make
an impression on him.

81
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:15,090
Deal?

82
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:17,940
No, this one is for me.

83
00:07:18,340 --> 00:07:20,320
He falls by my hand alone.

84
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:24,240
Don't misunderstand me, Jojo.

85
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:29,320
Honestly, this is something in
which I will take no pleasure.

86
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,577
We were raised in the same house.

87
00:07:31,660 --> 00:07:34,217
And the prospect of turning
you into an United thing?

88
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:35,829
is not a happy one for me.

89
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:40,206
That's why I wanted you to be
quickly dispatched by my knights.

90
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:44,980
But it would seem, in the
end, I underestimated you.

91
00:07:45,660 --> 00:07:50,380
Seeing you here, alive, brings me to
the realization that as an emperor,

92
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,880
I was being far too soft.

93
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:58,400
But now, now I'll put you to death
without a moment's thought or compunction!

94
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,180
I could say the same!

95
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:03,137
I will feel no hint of
guilt for your death!

96
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:06,160
But first I have a question, Jojo.

97
00:08:06,580 --> 00:08:09,933
Whatever happened to that
mustachioed charlatan of yours?

98
00:08:10,140 --> 00:08:11,669
You seem to have lost him.

99
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:13,260
Hear me, Dio.

100
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:18,237
It shames me as a gentleman to say this,
but I can no longer hold back the truth.

101
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:21,100
I, Jonathan Joestar,
have such hatred for you.

102
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,140
Vengeance consumes me!

103
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:25,620
I swear I will kill you!

104
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,400
Come, Jojo!

105
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,900
Come, Jojo!

106
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:43,620
What are you doing?

107
00:08:43,820 --> 00:08:45,700
Jojo, please step aside.

108
00:08:46,220 --> 00:08:47,840
I have a prior claim.

109
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:50,747
It is my right to avenge
my friend's killing.

110
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:55,880
Zeppeli was a brave man and boon companion
through two decades of harsh training.

111
00:08:57,160 --> 00:09:01,540
Dia, for his life, I shall now send
you to the bowels of hell itself!

112
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,940
No, wait, Dia.

113
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:04,420
Listen to me, D .O.

114
00:09:04,620 --> 00:09:07,679
has hidden abilities for
which you are not prepared!

115
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:15,080
There's an interesting walk.

116
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:18,737
Apparently, with decades
of the proper training,

117
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:22,217
mere humans can enable themselves
to float through the air.

118
00:09:22,300 --> 00:09:28,180
But in only a single night, I attained
power far surpassing that of any human guru!

119
00:09:33,220 --> 00:09:35,877
You truly think you can
defeat me in this manner?

120
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,548
Like you were sleepwalking?

121
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,900
Fell for it, didn't you fool?

122
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:48,040
Thundercross split attack!

123
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,470
Uncanny!

124
00:09:50,553 --> 00:09:51,637
In crossing his arms,

125
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:55,377
he can mount an attack while still
keeping his guard up for protection!

126
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:57,120
An incredible strategy!

127
00:09:57,480 --> 00:10:00,421
No fighter has ever been
able to escape this move.

128
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:09,300
Oh no!

129
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:13,080
Useless! Useless! Useless!

130
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:16,000
I can't! I can't move!

131
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,320
He froze Dio!

132
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:22,477
Dio must have somehow chilled all
the moisture in his body at once,

133
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:24,501
turning him to ice in an instant!

134
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,680
Dio can't control his hormone!

135
00:10:27,020 --> 00:10:30,196
He can't send it into Dio
unless his blood is flowing!

136
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:31,730
Struth!

137
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:34,097
That Dio's a fearsome
creature right enough.

138
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:36,620
He froze Dio's whole body at once!

139
00:10:37,300 --> 00:10:39,020
How did you do this?

140
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:42,080
Oh, we are feeble, aren't we?

141
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:45,740
You imbecile, you dare think
you could lay a finger on me!

142
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:50,922
You're the one who's going to give
up your life like some mongrel!

143
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:55,080
Let's endeavor to give them
a good show, shall we? No!

144
00:10:55,300 --> 00:10:56,620
Dio, stop it now!

145
00:11:07,020 --> 00:11:08,860
It's time, Jojo!

146
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:12,060
You're the next I shall
dispatch to oblivion!

147
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,630
Dire!

148
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:23,880
Those hormone-filled roses
thorns do sting a bit.

149
00:11:26,620 --> 00:11:27,450
Liar!

150
00:11:29,940 --> 00:11:31,500
Insect, how dare?

151
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:33,800
How dare you wound me?

152
00:11:33,980 --> 00:11:35,200
Wound my face?

153
00:11:35,980 --> 00:11:36,810
Dyer, no.

154
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:43,220
Speed wagon! My sword! Catch!

155
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:47,630
Kyo!

156
00:11:47,820 --> 00:11:50,060
I know exactly how to deal with you.

157
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:54,737
Dyer gave up his life, which showed
me just how vulnerable you are.

158
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:56,860
It will be very easy for me now.

159
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,786
You won't be able to stop it.

160
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:02,257
All I need to do is fill Bluford's
Sword of Luck and Pluck with Hamon,

161
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:03,920
and slice you with it!

162
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:13,840
You dare to touch me, filthy human.

163
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:16,620
You dare to touch me with your Hamon!

164
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:19,040
More disgusting than frog urine!

165
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:21,380
Your string of luck's run out!

166
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:25,880
Now you shall be father for my zombies!

167
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:29,660
They will gnaw the faces
right off your skulls!

168
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:30,600
Now we see!

169
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:34,677
He shows his true colors as someone
fit only to rule over a dung heap!

170
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:38,820
His cool, taut sophistication,
nothing but a cheap mask!

171
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,817
Now that he's had himself a nice,

172
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:45,040
humiliating taste of harmone, he
reveals his true, filthy self!

173
00:12:49,300 --> 00:12:50,476
Straitzoe's my name.

174
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:51,640
No mercy.

175
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:55,640
Page would be my name. Jones!

176
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:57,050
Plant!

177
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:58,520
Born on!

178
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,480
Needle vein strike!

179
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:07,800
Roses are alive and vital!

180
00:13:08,140 --> 00:13:10,057
So harmon will remain inside them?

181
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:11,957
flowing along with their life force.

182
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:14,628
But the same thing
cannot be said for steel.

183
00:13:17,540 --> 00:13:19,940
It's necessary to make contact.

184
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:24,740
A great many of them are coming.

185
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:28,240
If you wish, I shall handle them for you.

186
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:41,540
From all the indications I've seen, that
bloke deals more swift than any leopard.

187
00:13:43,620 --> 00:13:47,100
But with Zeppeli's Harmon,
Jonathan just might keep up.

188
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:54,640
Though, Dio is strong enough to pulverize
flesh and bone with a flick of his wrist.

189
00:13:55,200 --> 00:14:00,340
For the both of them, it could be up to
what happens in the very first moment.

190
00:14:09,020 --> 00:14:12,340
I will squeeze the life out
of you with my own hands!

191
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:15,700
I will cleanse the world
of your evil influence!

192
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,310
What?

193
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:21,244
He snatched up some roses
when I wasn't looking!

194
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,480
Come now!

195
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,320
Wait, that's good!

196
00:14:27,580 --> 00:14:29,277
He circled around to the right!

197
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:30,977
Dio is blind on that side.

198
00:14:31,060 --> 00:14:32,320
Take this, Dio!

199
00:14:32,700 --> 00:14:33,720
No, damn it all!

200
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:35,861
He knows exactly what he's doing!

201
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:49,140
Yes, kill him!

202
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:56,540
He finally defeated Dio!

203
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:02,317
Defeated you fools?

204
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:05,297
Oh no, I can't move!

205
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:07,517
I'm frozen!

206
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:10,460
You're so feeble, Jojo!

207
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:16,489
Now weakling, you shall join
my other children of the night!

208
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:24,137
I've got your rubbery little
karate between my fingers!

209
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:26,737
So warm and springy!

210
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:29,000
A strangely pleasant? feeling.

211
00:15:29,460 --> 00:15:30,580
A kick!

212
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:45,960
Enjoying this anguished Jojo?

213
00:15:46,580 --> 00:15:50,237
One tiny little move and
this delicate blood vessel?

214
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:52,200
snaps in two like a wet ribbon.

215
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:55,620
With your carotid open, all
your blood will be mine.

216
00:15:55,900 --> 00:15:59,700
Then I shall fill the vacancy
with my own Vampiric Essence,

217
00:15:59,820 --> 00:16:01,660
and you will be my thrall!

218
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:03,980
We have to help him!

219
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,280
Zombies, to me!

220
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,800
Keep those peasants back.

221
00:16:09,040 --> 00:16:10,280
I'm rather busy.

222
00:16:11,620 --> 00:16:14,340
Nothing seems to stem
this tide of zombies.

223
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:17,060
We cannot provide any help.

224
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:23,520
Now, Shuichi, in your last moment of free
will, realize that the victory was mine!

225
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:24,760
No, Dio.

226
00:16:25,140 --> 00:16:26,477
You've not won yet.

227
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:29,517
You've made a fatal mistake? How?

228
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:33,097
So you see Dio?

229
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:34,377
If you freeze me completely,

230
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:37,437
you'll not be able to continue
feeding on my life energy.

231
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:41,057
This means however that
my hormone is unaffected.

232
00:16:41,140 --> 00:16:44,237
You can't block it as long as
I remain partially unfrozen.

233
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:47,957
Your tactics to say the
least are somewhat blah.

234
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:51,797
How long has the sword
been in those flames?

235
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:55,717
The metal blade is conducting
heat from the fire faster.

236
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:57,212
so that I can freeze it.

237
00:16:57,800 --> 00:17:00,300
Hamon is blowing up the blade.

238
00:17:03,140 --> 00:17:05,680
Sunlight yellow, overdrive!

239
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:10,840
He's done it.

240
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:14,380
Not exactly correct.

241
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:17,938
It's quite evident the Hamon
did not make it through.

242
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:22,580
My arm, my arm is frozen solid again.

243
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:25,200
I only briefly touched his face.

244
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,060
This isn't over, Jojo.

245
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:38,700
I have to admit, I must
admire your tenaciousness.

246
00:17:39,060 --> 00:17:40,180
Really, I do.

247
00:17:40,380 --> 00:17:42,780
And your ingenious use of the flame.

248
00:17:43,260 --> 00:17:45,731
Truly marvelous example of quick thinking.

249
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:53,017
But really, Jojo, an emperor's
reach should exceed his grasp.

250
00:17:53,100 --> 00:17:55,820
Just a touch on the arm is all it takes.

251
00:17:56,140 --> 00:17:59,520
I can turn your whole body
to ice in two seconds!

252
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:06,100
The vampire essence!

253
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:07,377
He squeezed it out!

254
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:08,400
He's not done!

255
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:10,120
Jonathan won't give up!

256
00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:13,970
Really?

257
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:16,080
The let's do battle stance?

258
00:18:16,460 --> 00:18:17,780
You're not serious.

259
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:23,480
No matter how you prepare, Human
ability is extremely limited and finite.

260
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:26,800
Your Harmon training avails you nothing.

261
00:18:31,700 --> 00:18:34,800
A mere monkey can never defeat a lion!

262
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:40,300
In comparison to my power, you
are but a mere monkey, Jojo!

263
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:41,750
You're wrong!

264
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:45,637
With true conviction, the human
race can overcome anything!

265
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:49,217
Let me demonstrate to just what
heights a human being can rise!

266
00:18:49,300 --> 00:18:53,360
Don't waste your time, a
zombie is all you'll ever be!

267
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:01,200
Struth, his hand is burning!

268
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:04,386
Flames coming from his glove!

269
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:08,117
That might just have the power
to get through Dio's ice!

270
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:11,577
When this business is done,
which one of us will have fallen?

271
00:19:11,660 --> 00:19:13,400
We'll find out, Dio!

272
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:21,660
Dio's blocking Jojo!

273
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:26,080
But no!

274
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:28,100
It's breaking through!

275
00:19:42,840 --> 00:19:44,497
I'm disintegrating!

276
00:19:44,580 --> 00:19:45,500
It can't be!

277
00:19:49,300 --> 00:19:51,700
The pain, the burning, I can't!

278
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:59,680
My reign was to have lasted forever,

279
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:03,060
for centuries uncounted by man!

280
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:07,760
You had to be destroyed, Dio.

281
00:20:09,300 --> 00:20:11,100
I will not die!

282
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:29,237
How did he shot energy from out of his
eye he came to within only mere inches of

283
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:33,917
incinerating my brain
far too close the last

284
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:37,360
act the demon refuses to
acknowledge his death?

285
00:20:38,100 --> 00:20:40,320
Dio has fallen from the parapet!

286
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,070
Dio...

287
00:21:09,100 --> 00:21:10,460
Look, he fainted!

288
00:21:10,580 --> 00:21:12,440
He's worn out. Too right.

289
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:16,817
He's been in more fatal fights tonight
than a man should have in a lifetime.

290
00:21:16,900 --> 00:21:20,371
But why would he shed tears
for an evil creature like that?

291
00:21:23,420 --> 00:21:26,302
He weeps because they
spent their youth together.

292
00:21:26,700 --> 00:21:28,465
Dio was like a brother to him.

293
00:21:29,620 --> 00:21:32,800
But as for me, I could sing a song of joy.

294
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:37,381
Baron Zeppeli, were you watching?

295
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:41,060
He did it.

296
00:21:41,500 --> 00:21:43,697
Jonathan Joestar did it.

297
00:21:43,780 --> 00:21:45,057
Dio is dead.

298
00:21:45,140 --> 00:21:50,100
It may sound an exaggeration,
but JoJo saved the world tonight.

299
00:22:08,060 --> 00:22:11,837
The words will make you out and out.

300
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:15,020
You spent the day in your way.

301
00:22:17,180 --> 00:22:19,777
Calling morning, running through the sun.

302
00:22:19,860 --> 00:22:21,420
And in another valley.

303
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:25,900
We're on the lake.

304
00:22:26,940 --> 00:22:29,377
My heart's coming out of the sky.

305
00:22:29,460 --> 00:22:31,160
We stand there.

306
00:22:47,800 --> 00:22:50,517
We'll be

307
00:22:50,600 --> 00:22:55,120
right back.

308
00:23:10,880 --> 00:23:13,020
da, da, da, da, da,

309
00:23:22,379 --> 00:23:23,209
da,

310
00:23:24,205 --> 00:23:25,035
da,

311
00:23:30,380 --> 00:23:32,909
da It appears that I'm
crying out from joy.

312
00:23:33,060 --> 00:23:34,620
You must leave, Iran.

313
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:36,440
I want to stay like this.

314
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:39,200
Where is my body?
